Package: ggflexbcr
Type: Package
Title: A flexible bivariate cure model with shared random effect
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Saptangshu Nandi
Maintainer: Saptangshu Nandi <saptangshunandi331@gmail.com>
Description: This package provides implementation of a parametric shared frailty bivariate cure rate model.
    It includes the necessary functions and estimation methods using EM Algorithm as demonstrated in the paper.
